\newlabel{fig:generator:qm9-gcddg-rdkit-examples}{{4.4}{100}{RDKit visualisations of QM9-like molecules generated by the proposed graph-conditioned denoising generator from held-out graph-level molecular conditions. These examples are qualitative samples; aggregate distributional comparisons are reported separately}{figure.caption.96}{}}
