\newlabel{tab:qm9-generated-vs-heldout-mmd}{{4.1}{100}{Scalar-property \(\mathrm {MMD}^2\) between molecules generated from held-out conditions and the held-out molecules that supplied those conditions. Smaller values indicate closer agreement with the conditioning-molecule distribution. Only the generated-versus-held-out-condition comparison is shown}{table.caption.97}{}}
